<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ametek Inc EPS view lifted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ametek Inc EPS view lifted.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman said it raised its earnings estimates for Ametek Inc, which is trading on a when-issued basis after spinning out its water filtration business to Culligan Water Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Harriet Baldwin raised her 1997 EPS estimate to $1.50 from $1.36 on a pro forma basis.</p>
<p>-- Price target $25 or 14.5 times 1998 EPS forecast of $1.70. Sees long term growth of 14 percent.</p>
<p>-- Shares were at 21-7/8.</p>
</text>
